# Author's Additional Terms — Royalty Provision

The following Additional Terms are imposed by the licensor
as conditions to the copyright and patent licenses granted
above. To the extent of any conflict between these Additional
Terms and the PolyForm Shield License 1.0.0 text, these
Additional Terms control.

## 1. Royalty Retention Condition

Your licenses under these terms are conditioned on your
retention of the built-in royalty (profit-sharing) feature
of the software, namely that all of the following remain
true in your deployment:

  a. the configuration setting `royalty.enabled` is `true`;

  b. the default royalty wallet address defined as
     `DEFAULT_ROYALTY_WALLET` in `royalty.py`
     (`TEf5qnzpBziem4myejR4uUkgyZ2jUEuz9r`) is not removed,
     replaced, or overridden with another address; and

  c. the configuration setting `royalty.rate_pct` is `10.0`
     or greater.

## 2. Technical Limitation

If automatic royalty withdrawal cannot be executed because
your OKX API key lacks Withdrawal authority or the royalty
wallet address has not been added to your withdrawal
whitelist, retention of the unmodified royalty feature in
code and configuration satisfies Section 1, provided the
royalty pool continues to accrue and you enable withdrawal
authority when practicable.

## 3. Commercial License

Any use of the software with the royalty feature removed,
disabled, or modified contrary to Section 1 requires a
separate commercial license from the licensor. Contact
the licensor via https://github.com/Xbs950812.

## 4. Chinese Reference Translation（中文参考译文）

以下为上述附加条款的中文参考译文，仅供参考；如与英文原文
存在歧义，以英文原文为准：

1. **分成保留条件**：你保留本软件内置的盈利分成（Royalty）功能
   是获得本许可证授权的条件，即在你的部署中须同时满足：
   a) 配置项 `royalty.enabled` 保持为 `true`；
   b) `royalty.py` 中定义的默认收款钱包地址
      `DEFAULT_ROYALTY_WALLET`（`TEf5qnzpBziem4myejR4uUkgyZ2jUEuz9r`）
      未被删除、替换或覆盖为其他地址；
   c) 配置项 `royalty.rate_pct` 不低于 `10.0`。

2. **技术限制**：若因你的 OKX API key 未开启提现权限、或收款地址
   未加入提现白名单而无法自动转出分成，只要你未修改代码与配置
   中的分成功能、分成池持续记账、并在条件允许时开启提现权限，
   即视为满足第 1 条。

3. **商业授权**：移除、禁用分成功能或以违反第 1 条的方式修改
   本软件的任何用途，均需另行取得许可方的商业授权。联系方式：
